# DAT Streaming

## Start session
```dart
final textureId = await MetaWearablesDat.startStreamSession(
  null, // null = AutoDeviceSelector
  fps: 24,
  streamQuality: StreamQuality.low,
  videoCodec: VideoCodec.raw,
);
// Render: Texture(textureId: textureId)
```

## Subscribe to state/errors BEFORE starting
- `streamSessionStateStream()` — stopping(0), stopped(1), waitingForDevice(2), starting(3), streaming(4), paused(5)
- `streamSessionErrorStream()` — `isThermalCritical`, `isHingesClosed`, `isPermissionDenied`

## Codecs
- `VideoCodec.raw` — iOS & Android, foreground only
- `VideoCodec.hvc1` — iOS only, foreground + background. Ignored on Android.

## Quality: low (360x640), medium (504x896), high (720x1280). FPS: 2, 7, 15, 24, 30.

## Photo capture
```dart
final photo = await MetaWearablesDat.capturePhoto(null, format: PhotoCaptureFormat.jpeg);
```

## Frame capture for ML
```dart
final frame = await MetaWearablesDat.captureStreamFrame(textureId); // ~3.7MB RGBA
```

See `example/lib/providers/stream_provider.dart` for canonical pattern.
